        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://goodview.govoffice.com/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original owner, Witt, named the area Goodview Subdivision in the early 20th century.",
